parameters.description:
Return only entries attributed to one of these principals, given as their
`metadata.author.id`. Specify the parameter multiple times to match any of several;
omitting it means unrestricted.

Return only entries recording one of these actions, by their compact code (see
`GET /audit-log/actions`). Specify the parameter multiple times to match any of several;
omitting it means unrestricted. An unknown code is rejected with `400 Bad Request`.
